      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Came to upvote and bump this request after trying to get drone camera type footage of an event in desktop mode. I'm able to fly around with the camera in desktop mode, but without a \"Stream Camera\", I cannot get good recording. \nThis would be very beneficial as these events get very taxing, and pulling out my camera to do the same thing in VR mode makes my framerate too low for good footage.\nI would expect it could work as a dedicated button toggle to switch between Avatar View and Camera View, or simply be something you can turn on and then exit out of with the Start or B buttons.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
