  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-13T10:58:04.535Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Alright, I tested out the Desktop Camera so far, it's pretty nice.\nHowever, these are my suggestions.\n- I can access the Radial Menu while in camera, feels awkward to close it while doing a small change then opening it again at the Menu.\n- The camera can be tilted or some sort like a portrait or angles, for better looking shots if needed!\n- Camera doesn't close itself when opening menu, that way I can access the Quick stuff like Expressions on the Quick Menu Wing system.\n- Stream Camera for Desktop, Well this will sound weird but with this desktop users might use it to record videos and such.\nOverall, these are my suggestions. The camera is GREAT so far but I do hope these suggestions will be implemented.",
